# Live working values (Apps Script / Sheet IDs, NAS address, accounts) never enter git:
# the clean filter swaps them for KRUTART_REDACTED_* placeholders on commit and the smudge
# filter puts them back on checkout. Filter + secret map live in .git/ (see DEVELOPMENT/AGENTS.md).
*.py  filter=krutart-secrets
*.txt filter=krutart-secrets
